    "longBusinessSummary": "HDB Financial Services Limited operates as a non-banking financial company that provides lending services and business process outsourcing services in India. The company offers personal loans, business loans, micro lending loans, auto loans, two-wheeler loans, gold loans, loan against property, enterprise business loans, consumer durable loans, commercial vehicle loans, construction equipment loans, car loans, loan against lease rental, tractor loans, and general and life insurance products. Its BPO services include back-office services, such as forms processing, documents verification, finance and accounting services, and correspondence management; and front office services, consisting of contact center management, outbound marketing, and collection services. The company was incorporated in 2007 and is based in Mumbai, India. HDB Financial Services Limited is a subsidiary of HDFC Bank Limited.",
